          {
            "title": "Question: Absolute",
            "id": 82333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita memosisikan sebuah elemen relatif terhadap sisi-sisi halaman web?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>position: absolute;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>display: absolute;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>margin: absolute;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>position: absolute;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Notifikasi memakai <code>position: relative; left: 10px;</code>. Kamu ingin posisinya diukur dari tepi halaman.</p><p>Deklarasi mana yang harus menggantikan <code>position: relative;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>position: absolute;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>position: relative;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>display: absolute;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>position: absolute;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Out of flow",
            "id": 82335,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elemen mana yang dihapus dari alur normal?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\" name=\"style.css\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"p\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"position\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": absolute;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"margin\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"5px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">  Elemen <code>p</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">  Elemen <code>button</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Elemen <code>p</code> dan <code>button</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">  Elemen <code>p</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu hanya mengubah aturan paragraf menjadi <code>position: relative</code>. Elemen mana yang kemudian keluar dari alur normal?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\" name=\"style.css\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"p\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"position\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": absolute;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"margin\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"5px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Baik paragraf maupun tombol tidak keluar.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya paragraf.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hanya tombol.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Baik paragraf maupun tombol tidak keluar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
